  {
    "version": "0.1",
    "section": 2,
    "moments": [
      {
        "narration": "当我们拿到方程 z等于x平方加y平方 时，如何从方程准确读出它的曲面形状呢？我们可以用固定高度 z等于h 的水平截面去截这个曲面。",
        "delivery": "patient",
        "actions": [
          {
            "action": "create",
            "kind": "math",
            "timing": "during_speech",
            "content": {
              "latex": "\\begin{cases} z = x^2 + y^2 \\\\ z = h \\end{cases} \\implies x^2 + y^2 = h"
            },
            "role": "derivation",
            "placement": {
              "relation": "below",
              "reference": {
                "source": "reusable",
                "section": 1,
                "item": 4
              }
            }
          },
          {
            "action": "create",
            "kind": "math",
            "timing": "during_speech",
            "content": {
              "latex": "x^2 + y^2 = r^2 \\implies r = \\sqrt{h} \\quad (h \\ge 0)"
            },
            "reusable_item": 1,
            "role": "derivation",
            "placement": {
              "relation": "below",
              "reference": {
                "source": "local_board_item",
                "moment": 1,
                "item": 1
              }
            }
          },
          {
            "action": "focus",
            "timing": "during_speech",
            "intent": "引导学生通过联立方程求解截线",
            "references": [
              {
                "source": "reusable",
                "section": 1,
                "item": 3
              },
              {
                "source": "reusable",
                "section": 1,
                "item": 4
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "narration": "将 z等于h 代入曲面方程，得到平面上的曲线方程 x平方加y平方等于h。对比圆的标准方程 x平方加y平方等于r平方，可以清晰得出半径 r等于根号h。",
        "delivery": "emphatic",
        "actions": [
